or in-game automation and custom logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for custom textures, models and many other mod types</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Systems &amp; survival</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electricity, power grids and generators powering your entire base or ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oxygen and hydrogen for life support and thrusters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons and combat blocks for ship-to-ship battles and base defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GPS, remote control, voxel hands, controller support and more quality-of-life tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive language support with official and community localizations</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Space Engineers is a sandbox engineering game where you design and build ships, stations, and planetary bases in a fully destructible environment. Explore planets and space, mine resources, survive hazards, and engage in combat alone or with friends in Creative or Survival modes.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Polish, French, Italian, Finnish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Portuguese - Brazil, Swedish, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "reviews": "“Space Engineers bring you back to your childhood when you were fighting with your LEGO ships.”<br>9/10 – SCORE<br><br>“Space Engineers makes welding, joining and glazing seem like the best jobs in the world. It looks superb.”<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>“Buy, unless you are bereft of even the slightest shred of creativity”<br>PCGamesN<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/244850/3658a69c81af5f4014b0ffa88941285e74825b86/header.jpg?t=1785173739", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/244850/bda417a19c8595216234c1d416513ef073c92557/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785173739", "capsule_imagev5